// The declarations that used to take `{...}` alone take `(...)`:
// `::meta(...)`, not `::meta{...}`. `::vocabulary(ns){ ... }` and
// `::dictionary(name){ ... }` already had a `(...)` and keep the `{...}` body
// after it. The parser reads declarations without knowing what they mean, so
// one document can carry all of them.

